Model weights
  This repository contains no model weights. The weights trained with this code are published at
  https://huggingface.co/sankalpsthakur/methane-plume-compact under CC BY-NC 4.0. The released STARCOP
  checkpoints (https://huggingface.co/isp-uv-es/starcop, CC BY-NC 4.0) are not included; the kernels read
  them from a Kaggle dataset at run time and use them only as scored references.

STARCOP code (GPL-3.0)
  No code of spaceml-org/STARCOP is included. src/starcop_edge/official_check.py downloads that repository
  (GPL-3.0) at commit c4789268a3fa0395f92357429052f6f5fc748acb inside a Kaggle kernel at run time and calls
  its run_validation, to cross-check this repository's scorer. src/starcop_edge/metrics.py implements the
  metric definitions of the paper and of that code independently.

Architecture replica
  The class SMPLikeUnet in src/starcop_edge/models.py reproduces the layer layout and parameter names of the
  Unet of segmentation_models_pytorch with a MobileNetV2 encoder, so that the released checkpoints load. The
  notices and licences of those projects are in LICENSES/:
  - segmentation_models_pytorch: MIT License, Copyright (c) 2019, Pavel Iakubovskii
    (LICENSES/MIT-segmentation_models_pytorch.txt).
  - torchvision (MobileNetV2): BSD 3-Clause License, Copyright (c) Soumith Chintala 2016, All rights reserved
    (LICENSES/BSD-3-Clause-torchvision.txt).
